{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"There is a knock on the door, as it is opened by a short dragonborn individual. \"Excuse me?\" they ask. \"I'm looking for Eliot?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:27:16.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879567511690031115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
