{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"(how populated is it atm?)","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:32:16.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879568771424084010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Absolutely. We're open all hours to cater to those around the clock.\" Eliot explains \n(Currently a bit of a lull, an in between of the  day timers dinner rush and the night owls breakfast rush.)","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:35:12.297000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879569507910291466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They smile. \"Excellent. I'll have whatever you recommend.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:39:00.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879570464207417344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Absolutely. Do you mind if I ask you your name?\" Elliot asks, escorting the dragonborn to a table in the center of the room.","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:40:02.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879570723633500170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod and sit down. \"My full name's a bit long, but you can call me wolf.\" They smile with sharp teeth.","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:41:24.369000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879571068493393950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"A shiver travels down Eliot's spine and he stands a bit taller. \"Ah. Yes. I was expecting you Mx. Wolf. I'll bring food out to you in just a moment. Would you like anything to drink?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:47:02.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879572485652250634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They shake their head. \"Just a small glass of water would be lovely. And bring one for yourself, I'd love to talk.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T03:53:15.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879574052279308298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot bows before departing, first delivering the glass of water before preparing a small platter of food. \n\nEliot whispers something to Willow who goes and waits outside. \n\nEliot returns to the table with The Wolf  with a cup for himself, three muffins, a cream horn, eight croissants, a loaf of banana bread, two whoopie pies, and a dozen cookies.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:02:27.551000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879576366662688788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"That's awfully kind of you, but I don't know if I can eat all this. I had a lovely meal earlier today, actually.\" They smile with sharp teeth and begin on a small slice of banana bread.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:11:38.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879578678168809492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"That's quite alright. Eat what you'd like, the rest you can take for later. That said, the cream horn is best fresh.\" Eliot says taking a seat across from the wolf.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:14:19.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879579353695010827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They smile, and once finished with the slice of banana bread, start on the cream horn. They eat in silence, intently watching Eliot.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:21:13.684000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879581090006835220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot's hand taps against his thigh nervously as he attempts to hold eye contact with The Wolf. His mouth moves to speak but stops, waiting in the silence.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:26:47.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879582488933048341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Please, what's on your mind?\" The wolf asks, delicately cleaning their hands of cream.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:29:05.496000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879583068929818635","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Did I meet your expectations?\" Eliot asks, as he stops his hand from tapping.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:31:46.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879583744707686441","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Well it's certainly delicious, but I think you and i both know this isn't really the food I prefer.\" The wolf says, taking a sip of water.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:41:36.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879586219196035082","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"You still had a taste.\" Eliot says coldly before he rubs his neck uncomfortably, smearing make and a minor illusion to reveal a scar from The Wolf's bite.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:46:26.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879587434399158272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf chuckles. \"You are as delicious as your food. Ordinairily, I would take great joy in incapacitating you, dragging you to my lair, and feeding. However, we did make a deal. I intend to uphold my end, if you uphold yours.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:48:10.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879587871227514921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"And what part of our agreement are you referring to?\" Eliot asks.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:50:02.056000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879588339324452914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"You agreed to feed me.\" Smiles the wolf. \"And this kind of food, while made excellently, is not actually suitable to my needs. You were smart enough to make a deal. I'm sure your smart enough to do the math.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:52:51.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879589051953471518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"It would seem I'm not as smart as you believe me to me.  Partly while desperate. Dying.  And filled with a terror you cannot even *begin* to comprehend.\" Eliot says coldly, locking eyes with The Wolf. \"I'm a humble cafè owner. You complimented my food. I offered more. As much as a gluttonous wolf could desire.\" Eliot's fist tightens beneath the table.","created_at":"2021-08-24T04:57:55.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879590325885231104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf sighs. \"Were I kinder, and able to sustain myself on your food alone, I would be more than happy to call our deal good. But I am *not* kind.\" The wolf says, standing up as its jaws and teeth morph. \"And your food is not what i *need*.\" The wolf slams down upon the table and looks at you hungrily. \n\nThere is a long, quiet pause before the wolf takes a deep breath and calms down. \"But i don't like to hunt in the open. I advise you find it within yourself to find me some food and bring it to where we met, or my end of the deal is off as well.\" They smile and exit the cafe","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:17:21.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879595214338158642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
