{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"How familiar are you with the wildlife of arcania, Eliot?\" Asks the wolf","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:37:12.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879600210291081226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot stares the wolf down. \"Depends on the kind. Im very familiar with the... ordinary kind.\" He  takes a moment to gestures towards the cafè. \"I've *heard* of some more... peculiar ones. But nothing more than rumors, until...\" Eliot touched the scar on his neck. \"Recently.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:40:00.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879600914682490900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf nods. \"First of all, those of us who are *peculiar*, as you put it, are all intelligent. I, for instance, am much more versed in spells and their nature than the average wolf. And I can also tell you this much: magic that relies on knowing the nature of a target or a group doesn't really work on us. We wouldn't be nearly as big of threats if we were. Your form for that *magic circle* is excellent, though.\" They smile wide. \"Now then, you were saying?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:51:46.505000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879603876909690910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Elliot grinds his teeth as the spell finishes regardless.  \"You asked how I expect to get out of this, preferably with my words. You came in here and said you wanted to talk. We have *plenty* more to discuss. And plenty of time to do it. Just because you're getting a little... peckish is no reason to  leave. I'd feel insulted if a guest leaves feeling unsatisfied.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:55:18.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879604764944510977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
