{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"What would you have us discuss?\" Asks the wolf. \"It seems we have reached a rather large impasse. There is something i believe you owe me, something you refuse to give.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:00:05.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879605971356373052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I've been living among the Fey. I know the nature of the deal. But it would seem we're under separate perceptions, so let's sort our cards.\" Eliot then begins to unbutton one of the cuffs to his shirt. \"But fret not, I'll make sure you're  compensated.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:03:42.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879606878005522472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf nods slowly, watching Eliot unbutton his cuff.","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:11:13.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879608772610383912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot pulls the sleeve up to his elbow,  but doesn't offer his arm. \"Are you open to discussion now? Or would you still prefer to scamper off?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:14:24.490000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879609572711628810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I have no intenion of scampering.\" Smiles the wolf","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:17:04.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879610244450385961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Good.\" Eliot says before extending the arm and holding up a single finger. \"For now,  you get one. As our discussion goes, you'll get more. If you get *greedy* however.... I simply recommend not doing that. \" Eliot says firmly","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:20:15.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879611045944098816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf chuckles lightly. \"I am not so hungry that I cannot wait. Should we reach an agreement, I would be happy to walk out of here having eaten none of your arms. Should we fail to do so... well, i think in that scenario all bets are off.\" They grin. \"Now please, what do you propose?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:23:20.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879611819315040276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I was offering a bite. Not the arm. Regardless.\" Eliot says,  leaving his arm in place. \"Do you recall the *exact* wording of our arrangement?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:26:02.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879612500491010049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf nods. \"You make me 'all the food i want', you 'protect me', and I stop hurting you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:28:17.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879613067057578014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"Eliot nods. \" 'All the food you want', one could say I've just fulfilled that. I made you food you ate until you wanted no more. You disagree however, you want something more... specific. The food was never implied to  be sustainable, just that I made it. Which I did.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:35:12.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879614807727292426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"One could also argue 'all the food i want' is to make for me every piece of food i want forever. Do you have a point beyond semantics?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:37:37.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879615416715071528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"My *point* is exactly what do you want? I'm attempting to get us on the same page Mx. Wolf.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:39:14.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879615822191009803","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"I want you to help me find and kill my meals. A lot of creatures are much easier to trick with a team. The war has helped somewhat in that department, but still.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:40:15.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879616078295220225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Alas, that I won't do. *I* run a cafe. I'm not a murderer. But, there is perhaps *something* to be done with that desire. Something I *can* help with.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:43:04.096000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879616785261936650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"The wolf nods and looks at Eliot expectantly.","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:47:46.568000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879617970035376138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"\"Tell me, Mx. Wolf. When you aren't able to feast upon someone like myself, what do you gorge yourself on?\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:49:41.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879618453919641650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852746408783904798","content":"They nod slowly to themselves. \"See, I knew you were smart enough to figure this one out. Yes, I can sustain myself by feeding on non-sapient creatures such as sheep and cattle.\" They sigh. \"But if I was content with that, I would not be here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:52:57.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879619275290193940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
